  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty good, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I save seeds from my tomatoes for next year?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "block": "gardening.dlg30",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You can, as long as they're not hybrids. If the packet said hybrid, the new plants might not match the parent.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.94,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "gardening.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, something else. My daughter wants a games console for her birthday.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 1.25,
   "block": "video_games.ctx2",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Lovely. Does she mostly want to play on the TV with the family, or carry it around and play on her own?",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.ctx2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, twenty seconds on the clock, then hit me with it again.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "think_time",
   "wait_sec": 20,
   "phrasing": "think_instruction_v2_32"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, I've got it.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "anchor": {
    "turn": 6,
    "offset": 9.77
   },
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "early_end",
   "phrasing": "early_end_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay, what do you think she'd use more, a family console or a portable one?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "video_games.ctx2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The TV. Honestly I want to play with her too.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "video_games.ctx2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's sweet. Pick one with good local multiplayer and grab a second controller.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.92,
   "role": "followup",
   "block": "video_games.ctx2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "These are old heirloom ones from my uncle.",
